                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The ability to simplify means to eliminate the unnecessary so that the necessary may speak.\n—HANS HOFMANN",
            "block_bbox": [
                200,
                371,
                675,
                441
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "global_block_id": 1,
            "global_group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    200.0,
                    371.0
                ],
                [
                    675.0,
                    371.0
                ],
                [
                    675.0,
                    441.0
                ],
                [
                    200.0,
                    441.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "You write more clearly when you match your characters and actions with your subjects and verbs, when you get the right characters into topics and the right words under stress, when you motivate readers with well-crafted introductions, and when you frame your paragraphs, sections, and documents to help readers grasp their global coherence. But readers may still think your prose a long way from graceful if it's anything like this:",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                470,
                785,
                625
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    470.0
                ],
                [
                    785.0,
                    470.0
                ],
                [
                    785.0,
                    625.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    625.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In my personal opinion, it is necessary that we should not ignore the opportunity to think over each and every suggestion offered.",
            "block_bbox": [
                122,
                637,
                754,
                686
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    122.0,
                    637.0
                ],
                [
                    754.0,
                    637.0
                ],
                [
                    754.0,
                    686.0
                ],
                [
                    122.0,
                    686.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "That sentence matches characters with subjects and actions with verbs but in too many words: opinion is always personal, so we don't need personal, and since this statement is opinion, we don't need in my opinion. Think over and not ignore both mean consider. Each and every is redundant. And suggestion is by definition offered. In fewer words:",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                701,
                785,
                830
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    701.0
                ],
                [
                    785.0,
                    701.0
                ],
                [
                    785.0,
                    830.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    830.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We should consider each suggestion.",
            "block_bbox": [
                99,
                841,
                410,
                866
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    99.0,
                    841.0
                ],
                [
                    410.0,
                    841.0
                ],
                [
                    410.0,
                    866.0
                ],
                [
                    99.0,
                    866.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Though not yet shapely or elegant, that sentence at least has the virtue of compactness or, as we'll call it, concision.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                881,
                782,
                932
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    881.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    881.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    932.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    932.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "How to Revise: Concision",
            "block_bbox": [
                92,
                957,
                418,
                986
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    92.0,
                    957.0
                ],
                [
                    418.0,
                    957.0
                ],
                [
                    418.0,
                    986.0
                ],
                [
                    92.0,
                    986.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Readers think you write concisely when you use just the words you need to say what you mean. Here are six principles that help you do that:",
            "block_bbox": [
                92,
                1001,
                782,
                1052
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    92.0,
                    1001.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    1001.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    1052.0
                ],
                [
                    92.0,
                    1052.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Delete words that mean little or nothing.",
            "block_bbox": [
                92,
                1065,
                464,
                1089
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    92.0,
                    1065.0
                ],
                [
                    464.0,
                    1065.0
                ],
                [
                    464.0,
                    1089.0
                ],
                [
                    92.0,
                    1089.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Delete words that repeat the meaning of other words.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                1097,
                571,
                1120
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "global_block_id": 10,
            "global_group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    1097.0
                ],
                [
                    571.0,
                    1097.0
                ],
                [
                    571.0,
                    1120.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    1120.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Delete words implied by other words.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                1129,
                442,
                1152
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 11,
